<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - FreshMarket</title>
    <style>
        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
        body {
            background: url('/images/backgrounds/landing.jpg') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .nav, .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .nav { background:rgba(255,255,255,.98); padding:1rem 0; box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
        .container { width:90%; max-width:1200px; margin:2rem auto; }
        .nav-content { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
        .logo { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; color:#667eea; }
        .nav-links { display:flex; gap:1.5rem; }
        .nav-links a { color:#333; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; padding:.5rem 1rem; border-radius:.5rem; transition:all .2s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { background:#667eea; color:#fff; }
        
        .about-section {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 { color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        h2 { color: #667eea; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
        p { line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .feature-box {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="nav-content">
                <div class="logo">🛒 FreshMarket</div>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="/">Home</a>
                    <a href="/about">About</a>
                    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                    <% if (user) { %>
                        <a href="<%= user.role === 'admin' ? '/inventory' : '/shopping' %>">
                            <%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Inventory' : 'Shop' %>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login">Login</a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-section">
            <h1>About FreshMarket</h1>
            <p>Welcome to FreshMarket, your trusted partner for fresh groceries and everyday essentials since 2024.</p>
            
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>To provide high-quality, fresh groceries at affordable prices while delivering exceptional customer service. We believe everyone deserves access to fresh, healthy food.</p>
            
            <h2>Why Choose Us</h2>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🌱</div>
                    <h3>Fresh Quality</h3>
                    <p>Sourced daily from local farms</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div class="feature-icon">💰</div>
                    <h3>Best Prices</h3>
                    <p>Competitive pricing guaranteed</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🚚</div>
                    <h3>Fast Delivery</h3>
                    <p>Same-day delivery available</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div class="feature-icon">✅</div>
                    <h3>Quality Assured</h3>
                    <p>100% satisfaction guarantee</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2>Our Story</h2>
            <p>Founded in 2024, FreshMarket started as a small local grocery store with a simple mission: to make fresh, quality groceries accessible to everyone. Today, we serve thousands of happy customers with our online platform, bringing the best products right to your doorstep.</p>
            
            <p>Our team carefully selects each product, working directly with local farmers and trusted suppliers to ensure you get the freshest produce, dairy, meat, and more.</p>

            <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2rem">
                <a href="/shopping" style="display:inline-block;padding:1rem 3rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#667eea,#764ba2);color:#fff;border-radius:.7rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem">Start Shopping</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
